1
00:00:00,931 --> 00:00:03,131
(Bernadette:)Let me see the sonogram again.

2
00:00:04,534 --> 00:00:07,534
(Bernadette:)Oh, yeah, that's a good-looking
baby for a little gray blob.

3
00:00:07,604 --> 00:00:10,274
(Howard:)Yeah, we could
name him Blobert.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,940
(Bernadette:)What if it's a girl?

5
00:00:12,008 --> 00:00:13,738
(Howard:)Bloberta.

6
00:00:15,045 --> 00:00:16,475
Or Blobbi with an "I."

7
00:00:16,546 --> 00:00:20,116
(Bernadette:)Are we being silly
not finding out the sex?

8
00:00:20,183 --> 00:00:22,623
(Howard:)Yeah, I was just
thinking the same thing.

9
00:00:22,686 --> 00:00:24,556
(Sheldon:)If you want,
you can find out right now.

10
00:00:24,621 --> 00:00:25,951
- Mm.
- Hmm.

11
00:00:26,022 --> 00:00:28,062
(Bernadette:)The doctor's gone for the
day, so it doesn't matter.

12
00:00:28,091 --> 00:00:29,221
(Raj:)Well, somebody else knows

13
00:00:29,292 --> 00:00:30,992
(Raj:)because they saw it
in the folder.

14
00:00:31,061 --> 00:00:33,031
(Bernadette:)You looked in
our folder?!

15
00:00:33,096 --> 00:00:34,166
(Raj:)It was an accident.

16
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:36,230
(Raj:)The doctor left
the folder out on her desk.

17
00:00:36,299 --> 00:00:39,439
(Raj:)It's not my fault
I opened it and looked.

18
00:00:39,502 --> 00:00:43,142
(Howard:)So you know the sex
of our baby, and we don't?!

19
00:00:43,206 --> 00:00:46,146
(Raj:)Flip a coin.
You got a fifty-fifty shot.

20
00:00:46,209 --> 00:00:48,139
(Howard:)It's unbelievable.

21
00:00:48,211 --> 00:00:49,481
- God, Raj.
- What?

22
00:00:49,546 --> 00:00:50,976
(Raj:)This is not a problem, okay?

23
00:00:51,047 --> 00:00:53,187
(Raj:)If you don't want to know,
I don't have to tell you.

24
00:00:53,249 --> 00:00:55,219
We don't want you to know!

25
00:00:55,285 --> 00:01:00,025
(Raj:)Okay, well, that's a problem.

